writing_quality.limitations_discussion_p.reason:
Limitations are explicit and task-relevant:
- fixed Hamiltonian pool, noiseless gates, conditional LSM initialisation;
- routing gains not implying better noisy fidelity;
- no Trotter, SABRE or tket comparison;
- single system size;
- factorial embedding enumeration not scalable;
- RFG's sensitivity to its own initial map untested;
- local guarantee not giving global fidelity or depth;
- deterministic single trajectories.

